// Des: HTTP request parsing, replies, gate, static guard
// Flo: requRead (discardAll(1) per line: 0.16 keeps '\n') > gate (Host pin, Origin, Sec-Fetch) > route > respSend or respStatSend
// I/O: raw TCP stream (browser) > Requ struct, HTTP responses (sv-main-serv, sv-stat-cach); no CORS header, gate is the CSRF defense
